{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NNuhVr1HT4ve8i8yGmbekZ","type":"tool_result","content":"# notes-mcp\n\nA small remote MCP server for my garden notes, meant for Claude Code, Codex\nand Gemini clients. Streamable HTTP, JSON responses, Python standard library.\n\n```\npython3 server.py              # http://127.0.0.1:49896/mcp\nPORT=9000 python3 server.py\n```\n\nTools: `search_notes` (read), `get_note` (read), `add_note` (write, needs\n`Authorization: Bearer dev-token-123` in development).\n\nNot yet listed in any registry. No CI. Logs go to stderr, one JSON line per\ncall.\n[\n  {\"id\": \"n-1\", \"title\": \"Soil pH kit review\", \"body\": \"The cheap colour kit reads 0.5 high against the lab. Fine for trend, not for liming decisions.\", \"tags\": [\"soil\"]},\n  {\"id\": \"n-2\", \"title\": \"Compost thermometer week 3\", \"body\": \"Core at 61C on day 18, turned the pile, back to 55C by day 21. Moisture felt right.\", \"tags\": [\"compost\"]},\n  {\"id\": \"n-3\", \"title\": \"Drip line pressure\", \"body\": \"Emitters past the 30 m mark starve at 1 bar. A second feed from the far end fixed it.\", \"tags\": [\"irrigation\"]},\n  {\"id\": \"n-4\", \"title\": \"First frost dates\", \"body\": \"Ten years of first frost: median Oct 24, earliest Oct 9. Cover beds by Oct 15.\", \"tags\": [\"weather\"]},\n  {\"id\": \"n-5\", \"title\": \"Rain barrel overflow\", \"body\": \"Overflow into the swale, not the path. Added a 50 mm elbow and a leaf screen.\", \"tags\": [\"water\"]}\n]\n--- init\nHTTP/1.0 200 OK\r\nContent-Type: application/json\r\nContent-Length: 315\r\nMcp-Session-Id: 374ff32c609a4535a66202f9f1918a52\r\n\r\n{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": 1, \"result\": {\"protocolVersion\": \"2025-06-18\", \"capabilities\": {\"tools\": {\"listChanged\": false}, \"resources\": {\"subscribe\": false, \"listChanged\": false}}, \"serverInfo\": {\"name\": \"notes-mcp\", \"version\": \"0.3.1\"}, \"instructions\": \"Search and read notes. add_note needs a signed-in session.\"}}\n\n--- get_note\nHTTP/1.0 200 OK\r\nContent-Type: application/json\r\nContent-Length: 503\r\n\r\n{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": 2, \"result\": {\"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"{\\\"id\\\": \\\"n-1\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Soil pH kit review\\\", \\\"body\\\": \\\"The cheap colour kit reads 0.5 high against the lab. Fine for trend, not for liming decisions.\\\", \\\"words\\\": 17, \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"soil\\\"]}\"}], \"isError\": false, \"structuredContent\": {\"id\": \"n-1\", \"title\": \"Soil pH kit review\", \"body\": \"The cheap colour kit reads 0.5 high against the lab. Fine for trend, not for liming decisions.\", \"words\": 17, \"tags\": [\"soil\"]}}}\n\n--- search\nHTTP/1.0 200 OK\r\nContent-Type: application/json\r\nContent-Length: 1531\r\n\r\n{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": 3, \"result\": {\"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"[{\\\"id\\\": \\\"n-1\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Soil pH kit review\\\", \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"The cheap colour kit reads 0.5 high against the lab. Fine for trend, not for\\\"}, {\\\"id\\\": \\\"n-2\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Compost thermometer week 3\\\", \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"re at 61C on day 18, turned the pile, back to 55C by day 21. Moisture felt right\\\"}, {\\\"id\\\": \\\"n-3\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Drip line pressure\\\", \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Emitters past the 30 m mark starve at 1 bar. A second feed from the far end fix\\\"}, {\\\"id\\\": \\\"n-4\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"First frost dates\\\", \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Ten years of first frost: median Oct 24, earliest Oct 9. Cover \\\"}, {\\\"id\\\": \\\"n-5\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Rain barrel overflow\\\", \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Overflow into the swale, not the path. Added a 50 m\\\"}]\"}], \"isError\": false, \"structuredContent\": {\"hits\": [{\"id\": \"n-1\", \"title\": \"Soil pH kit review\", \"snippet\": \"The cheap colour kit reads 0.5 high against the lab. Fine for trend, not for\"}, {\"id\": \"n-2\", \"title\": \"Compost the